-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"colors\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Colors by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miquel_Muerto\" title=\"Miquel Muerto\">Miquel Muerto</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"letters\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Lettered by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/AndWorld_Design\" title=\"AndWorld Design\">AndWorld Design</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">September 20, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Chronology</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_32\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 32\">Something Is Killing the Children #32</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_34\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 34\">Something Is Killing the Children #34</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #33</b> is a horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that was published on September 20, 2023, by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>. It is the thirty-third issue in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<p>Help finally arrives in the town of Tribulation, but whose side are they on? Most importantly, with <span class=\"new\" title=\"Cutter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ3V0dGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Cutter</span> in deadly pursuit and the <a href=\"/wiki/Duplicitype\" title=\"Duplicitype\">Duplicitype</a> still very much a threat, what chance does <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a> stand?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"